HB0119 Minimum easement standards.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Banks and Allemand and Senator(s)
Laursen, D and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to eminent domain; requiring notice of condemnation as
specified; requiring clauses relating to liability, abandonment and
reclamation; providing requirements for existing easements; providing
compensation standards; specifying applicability; and providing for an
effective date.
